{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVE Vanguard</strong> is a persistent world where you extract loot, mine resources, craft weapons and upgrades, and make your mark on the game world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LETHAL PvPvE COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load yourself out and deploy down to the harsh, corrupted planets of New Eden via a stunning Star Map. Complete Expeditions and contracts, fight enemy hordes, team up with your friends, and fight your enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/ab5054c09dd8a169c65e4bf504901ed8.poster.avif?t=1768553818\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/ab5054c09dd8a169c65e4bf504901ed8.webm?t=1768553818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/ab5054c09dd8a169c65e4bf504901ed8.mp4?t=1768553818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR VANGUARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bank useful resources and items scavenged from the surface, and extract what you can carry. Earn rewards for completing Expeditions. Use your resources to craft more weapons, upgrades, ammunition, and gear to customize your experience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/f488c328ed04a0367ef89390d5683776.poster.avif?t=1768553818\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/f488c328ed04a0367ef89390d5683776.webm?t=1768553818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/f488c328ed04a0367ef89390d5683776.mp4?t=1768553818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CARVE YOUR PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stunning but dangerous planetary environments. Carve your own path through the wreckage of warships, poisoned swamps, alien jungles, and other harsh worlds.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/59465d3fe3f469d6044997f3315181f6.poster.avif?t=1768553818\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/59465d3fe3f469d6044997f3315181f6.webm?t=1768553818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/59465d3fe3f469d6044997f3315181f6.mp4?t=1768553818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE YOUR MARK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action matters in a persistent sandbox. Your choices define your legacy. Your ambition writes the fate of New Eden.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1872800?t=1768553818","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1872800?t=1768553818","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/669682a721c1c5a483acd909c35707c5830ce091/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768553818","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/669682a721c1c5a483acd909c35707c5830ce091/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768553818","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Vision</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/cad8bfcd6673d3a33cd9fda752bd0481.avif?t=1768553818\" width=780 height=660 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVE Vanguard</strong> is a persistent world where you extract loot, mine resources, craft weapons and upgrades, and make your mark on the game world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LETHAL PvPvE COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load yourself out and deploy down to the harsh, corrupted planets of New Eden via a stunning Star Map. Complete Expeditions and contracts, fight enemy hordes, team up with your friends, and fight your enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/ab5054c09dd8a169c65e4bf504901ed8.poster.avif?t=1768553818\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/ab5054c09dd8a169c65e4bf504901ed8.webm?t=1768553818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/ab5054c09dd8a169c65e4bf504901ed8.mp4?t=1768553818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR VANGUARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bank useful resources and items scavenged from the surface, and extract what you can carry. Earn rewards for completing Expeditions. Use your resources to craft more weapons, upgrades, ammunition, and gear to customize your experience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/f488c328ed04a0367ef89390d5683776.poster.avif?t=1768553818\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/f488c328ed04a0367ef89390d5683776.webm?t=1768553818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/f488c328ed04a0367ef89390d5683776.mp4?t=1768553818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CARVE YOUR PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stunning but dangerous planetary environments. Carve your own path through the wreckage of warships, poisoned swamps, alien jungles, and other harsh worlds.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/59465d3fe3f469d6044997f3315181f6.poster.avif?t=1768553818\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/59465d3fe3f469d6044997f3315181f6.webm?t=1768553818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/extras/59465d3fe3f469d6044997f3315181f6.mp4?t=1768553818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE YOUR MARK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action matters in a persistent sandbox. Your choices define your legacy. Your ambition writes the fate of New Eden.</p>","developers":["CCP"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/f941076776902f83cf73cf3c7b1d7ed48eaa6e71/header.jpg?t=1768553818