br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3080 / AMD Radeon RX 6900 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["CCP"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q3 2026"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cEVE Vanguard has the potential to innovate in the multiplayer space and also open a gateway for players like me to participate in the series\u2019 legendary stories from a fresh perspective.\u201d<br>GameInformer<br><br>\u201cA large part of that is because of the freedom of how you can play, but also because I love a bit of drama.\u201d<br>The Gamer<br><br>\u201cI'm very much picking up what Vanguard is putting down.\u201d<br>Eurogamer<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/cfe8682068f49d0b91fc2be6066a1c8c73a8fc6a/ss_cfe8682068f49d0b91fc2be6066a1c8c73a8fc6a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768553818","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/cfe8682068f49d0b91fc2be6066a1c8c73a8fc6a/ss_cfe8682068f49d0b91fc2be6066a1c8c73a8fc6a.600x338.jpg?t=1768553818"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/3fee1941a3d7068ba0493491cb6653a2e374b36d/ss_3fee1941a3d7068ba0493491cb6653a2e374b36d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768553818","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872800/3fee1941a3d7068ba0493491cb6653a2e374b36d/ss_3fee1941a3d7068ba0